    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      172.82,
      394.1,
      217.58
    ],
    "text": "Issued by the Natural Hazards Early Warning Centre Issued at 09.30 a.m. 26 October 2026, valid for the next 12 hours.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      105.98,
      220.61,
      509.19,
      234.65
    ],
    "text": "For Multi-day boats in the Bay of Bengal deep and shallow sea areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      237.26,
      308.78,
      276.14
    ],
    "text": "Take Action!",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      279.47,
      541.39,
      454.15
    ],
    "text": "The Deep Depression over East-central and adjoining Southeast Bay of Bengal has intensified into cyclonic storm \u201cArnab\u201d. It is moved westwards and lay centered at 5.30 a.m. of today, the 26th October, 2026, near Latitude 15.4\u00b0N and Longitude 88.9\u00b0E. It is very likely to move nearly west-northwestwards, and intensify further into a severe cyclonic storm over west central Bay of Bengal by 1800 UTC of 26th October and into a very severe cyclonic storm over the same region on 27th October. Wind speeds in the sea areas marked under the \u201cWarning\u201d category may increase to 80-100 kmph at times, heavy thundershowers can occur, the wave height may increase about (3.0 \u2013 4.0) meters in the mentioned sea areas and the sea conditions in these areas will become very rough.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      473.35,
      542.79,
      816.48
    ],
    "text": "Therefore, Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the sea areas bounded by 10N to 20N latitude and 80E to 95E longitude until further notice. Naval and fishing communities operating in those sea areas are advised to move away from the affected sea areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      841.92,
      541.16,
      938.16
    ],
    "text": "Naval and fishing communities engaging the activities over this sea area are advised to be vigilant and be attentive to the future forecasts and bulletins issued by the department of meteorology in this regards.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
